  "limits": [
    "Bench mean 0.934, short of 0.98. The lowest metric is the halo-speck histogram (0.71): the reference halo at 160 px spreads its specks evenly from L 0 to 150, the plate's ranked field puts more pixels at the dark floor and at L 70 to 120. The core's dark-green ink (0.80) and both ground spectra (0.79 to 0.81) follow: the reference carries JPEG block energy at 8 px that the plate does not imitate.",
    "Rejected: the earlier single-pass orbit with a gaussian profile; the reference strokes measure 14 px median and 18 px at p90 with a green fringe and a cyan core, which one even stroke cannot make.",
    "The orbits, hooks and gem are the plate's own. The reference's four pinwheel arcs and their eyes are not copied, so the whole-plate ink shares differ where the compositions differ: the reference's glow cloud fills more of the space inside its orbits."
  ],
